                 //
                 // ROOT FIX (fa 2026-10-01): the old form
                 //   clone && fetch && ! ancestor || exit 0 && merge...
                 // left-associates as
                 //   (clone && fetch && !ancestor) || (exit 0 && merge...)
                 // so a CLONE/NETWORK failure took the `|| exit 0`
